        "prompt": "打开被插销锁住的木盒，取出橘子并竖放在托盘上；松手后按红色 SUBMIT。",
        "explanation": "先注意插销与盒盖之间的阻挡，再看取物、放置和主动提交。视频展示官方开发示范的动作过程，不能据此推断某个模型的成功率。完整任务指令保留在原始记录 tasks[0]。",
        "raw": {
          "episode_index": 0,
          "tasks": [
            "Open the wooden puzzle box on the counter, take out the tangerine inside, and stand it inside the tray. The lid slides sideways but is locked by sliding bolts with round black handles: a part moves only when nothing blocks it, so work out the order. Any order that works is fine. Once the tangerine is inside the tray and you have let go of everything, press the red SUBMIT button. Your first submission ends the episode; a wrong submission or no submission fails."
          ],
          "length": 1740
        },
        "source": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/declare-lab/RoboQuest/blob/30952cee53890ec39a90fdef62e4e0dee3d2cf8b/lerobot/puzzle_box/meta/episodes.jsonl",
